                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc88de39-1881-3fe1-833d-a940ebbceab8",
                        "entry_id": "f608b08b-9425-3593-8f8a-fb26acfad769",
                        "glosses": [
                            "związany z numizmatyką"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35dd0842-e75f-427f-9cbd-20ad1dd54eaf",
                                "sense_id": "bc88de39-1881-3fe1-833d-a940ebbceab8",
                                "text": "Pan Leon rozwijał swoje zainteresowania numizmatyczne we wczesnej młodości."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "83f4228a-e097-4e19-8926-4e80d393f36b",
                        "source_entry_id": "f608b08b-9425-3593-8f8a-fb26acfad769",
                        "source_sense_id": "bc88de39-1881-3fe1-833d-a940ebbceab8",
                        "target_lang_word": "numismatic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "numismatic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "588b0429-aac1-3220-a89e-19b719735972",
                                        "entry_id": "3312df32-f633-33ee-adb0-6b14b3c872ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to currency, especially to coins."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54cad8ed-1aa4-4858-a04a-341bfa8552be",
                                                "sense_id": "588b0429-aac1-3220-a89e-19b719735972",
                                                "text": "After the deperdition of Indagator, having an appetency still further to pervstigate the frithy occident; being still an agamist, and not wishing to be any longer a pedaneous viator, nor to be solivagant, I brought about the emption of a yaud, partly by numismatic mutuation, and partly by a hypothecation of my fusee and argental horologe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebf302b7-a8d0-4f83-aadf-5bdb26d4dd35",
                                                "sense_id": "588b0429-aac1-3220-a89e-19b719735972",
                                                "text": "The most prevalent use of the acronym for the phrase is not in texts — which allowed for expansive writing — but upon numismatic evidence (i.e. coinage) where space was limited and thus often had familiar abbreviations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b775f76-e737-373b-a214-e0735d679635",
                                        "entry_id": "3312df32-f633-33ee-adb0-6b14b3c872ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to numismatics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19858b05-6e78-4566-8e9b-bf9dabcb4ae3",
                                                "sense_id": "0b775f76-e737-373b-a214-e0735d679635",
                                                "text": "Numismatic associations had argued before a State Department advisory committee that import restrictions on ancient coins could not fairly be enforced."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7711fc17-9f69-49ed-8964-70af9cc4fa04",
                        "source_entry_id": "f608b08b-9425-3593-8f8a-fb26acfad769",
                        "source_sense_id": "bc88de39-1881-3fe1-833d-a940ebbceab8",
                        "target_lang_word": "numismatique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "numismatique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7d47903-1077-38a8-9ca0-ac9505732227",
                                        "entry_id": "a5e7037c-3886-3eb5-aab5-ee3054f764ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à la monnaie et aux médailles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d655c5fd-91bd-4803-b971-0de4456b904a",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d47903-1077-38a8-9ca0-ac9505732227",
                                                "text": "La science numismatique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "numismatique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b0ff19d-86bd-3d67-b108-45c50a59a56a",
                                        "entry_id": "e9e8bd5f-19d1-327b-8ea5-179c894a8a30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Science des monnaies et médailles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b57c4e1d-bef4-4faf-87d4-dd563bb986ae",
                                                "sense_id": "5b0ff19d-86bd-3d67-b108-45c50a59a56a",
                                                "text": "C'est chose remarquable que la longue insouciance du public érudit pour la numismatique du moyen-âge. Les médaillistes, en ceci d'accord avec les écrivains, avec les artistes, naguère encore consacraient exclusivement leurs veilles à l'étude de la docte antiquité. Le grec et le romain, voilà ce dont se composait le médaillier d'un véritable amateur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae9847ba-06e3-48e5-bb60-a284793f50b4",
                                                "sense_id": "5b0ff19d-86bd-3d67-b108-45c50a59a56a",
                                                "text": "La céramique confirme et précise les données de la numismatique. Les fouilles du sanctuaire de Jublains ont livré des céramiques décorées au poinçon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "451cdd61-8e6a-44db-b16a-7378141c1235",
                        "source_entry_id": "f608b08b-9425-3593-8f8a-fb26acfad769",
                        "source_sense_id": "bc88de39-1881-3fe1-833d-a940ebbceab8",
                        "target_lang_word": "numismatisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
